<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:10.600" end="00:00:13.900" style="s2">Father, good morning.</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.500" end="00:00:15.100" style="s2">I don&#39;t even know how to pray this</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.900" end="00:00:16.800" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.100" end="00:00:18.600" style="s2">Yesterday they rejected my application</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.800" end="00:00:20.600" style="s2">again. The woman who promised to employ</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.600" end="00:00:22.500" style="s2">me has stopped answering my calls. My</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.600" end="00:00:24.400" style="s2">rent is due.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.500" end="00:00:26.000" style="s2">There is no food in this house. Even the</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.400" end="00:00:27.600" style="s2">people I call my friends are tired of</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.000" end="00:00:29.700" style="s2">hearing my problems. Am I doing</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.600" end="00:00:31.700" style="s2">something wrong? Have I offended you?</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.700" end="00:00:34.100" style="s2">Because I have fasted, I have cried, I</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.700" end="00:00:36.300" style="s2">have tried everything I know how to do.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.100" end="00:00:37.700" style="s2">But even if nothing changes today, I</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.300" end="00:00:39.600" style="s2">will still believe you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.700" end="00:00:40.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amara, AMARA,</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.600" end="00:00:42.100" style="s2">AMARA,</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.600" end="00:00:44.100" style="s2">ARE YOU INSIDE?</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.100" end="00:00:46.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, sir. Please, I am trying</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.100" end="00:00:47.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are always trying. Everybody is</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.100" end="00:00:48.800" style="s2">trying.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.300" end="00:00:50.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, sir, I know it&#39;s taking so long,</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.800" end="00:00:51.200" style="s2">but I promise to pay you</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.100" end="00:00:53.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to hear any excuses by</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.200" end="00:00:53.600" style="s2">Friday.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.600" end="00:00:59.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God will make a way.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.800" end="00:01:12.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When nobody believed [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.400" end="00:01:12.000" style="s2">in me</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.100" end="00:01:18.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why isn&#39;t Amara here yet?</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.100" end="00:01:20.300" style="s2">I don&#39;t know. I really hope she doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.700" end="00:01:23.240" style="s2">send us a Bible verse instead of telling</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.300" end="00:01:23.240" style="s2">us she won&#39;t make it. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.000" end="00:01:35.000" style="s2">Our princess has finally arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.800" end="00:01:36.400" style="s2">My sister, come and sit down. We thought</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.000" end="00:01:38.300" style="s2">you would send us a prayer request</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.400" end="00:01:40.200" style="s2">instead.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.300" end="00:01:42.700" style="s2">Good afternoon, everyone. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.200" end="00:01:44.000" style="s2">Good afternoon. At this time, you look</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.700" end="00:01:45.400" style="s2">like somebody who has been fighting the</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.000" end="00:01:46.766" style="s2">whole of Port Harcourt. Leave her. Maybe</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.400" end="00:01:47.800" style="s2">she was fasting.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.766" end="00:01:49.700" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.800" end="00:01:51.100" style="s2">You people haven&#39;t changed.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.700" end="00:01:52.600" style="s2">And you haven&#39;t changed either. Same</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.100" end="00:01:54.400" style="s2">clothes, same handbag, [music] same</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.600" end="00:01:56.500" style="s2">story.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.400" end="00:01:58.800" style="s2">Amara, be honest with us. How is life</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.500" end="00:02:00.392" style="s2">really going? I&#39;m managing. I had</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.800" end="00:02:01.292" style="s2">another interview</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.392" end="00:02:01.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another one?</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.292" end="00:02:04.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.992" end="00:02:07.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.092" end="00:02:08.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They said they would get back to me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.192" end="00:02:09.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At this point, even the people who</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.392" end="00:02:10.992" style="s2">interview you must know your face by</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.892" end="00:02:12.292" style="s2">heart. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.992" end="00:02:14.592" style="s2">have been looking for work for how long</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.292" end="00:02:16.192" style="s2">now? Two years?</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.592" end="00:02:18.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; a year and a half.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.192" end="00:02:20.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; year and a half, and you still believe</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.292" end="00:02:21.481" style="s2">that God is arranging something for you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.492" end="00:02:23.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.481" end="00:02:25.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.092" end="00:02:26.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; did you hear that? still believes.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.692" end="00:02:28.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is good,</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.892" end="00:02:29.392" style="s2">but even faith [music] needs an account</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.292" end="00:02:30.592" style="s2">balance.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.392" end="00:02:31.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon, ma. What would you like</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.592" end="00:02:32.892" style="s2">to order?</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.292" end="00:02:34.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring us the grilled fish, two plates of</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.892" end="00:02:36.092" style="s2">rice, and fresh juice.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.592" end="00:02:37.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you didn&#39;t order anything.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.092" end="00:02:38.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.292" end="00:02:39.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; perhaps your miracle hasn&#39;t food money</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.892" end="00:02:41.841" style="s2">yet.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.821" end="00:02:41.841" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.492" end="00:02:45.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; are you both doing this?</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.592" end="00:02:47.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what?</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.492" end="00:02:49.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; me feel small every time we meet. I know</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.892" end="00:02:51.492" style="s2">I am not where I want to be. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.692" end="00:02:53.092" style="s2">have to remind me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.492" end="00:02:55.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We are your friends. If we cannot tell</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.092" end="00:02:57.692" style="s2">you the truth, who will? Look at us.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.592" end="00:02:58.892" style="s2">Blessing has a good job. I&#39;m married. My</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.692" end="00:03:00.592" style="s2">husband is planning to buy another</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.892" end="00:03:02.292" style="s2">property. What exactly are you waiting</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.592" end="00:03:03.292" style="s2">for? No, you can&#39;t call yourself my</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.292" end="00:03:04.492" style="s2">friend.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.292" end="00:03:05.992" style="s2">Friends are supposed to be there for</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.492" end="00:03:08.092" style="s2">each other during difficult times, help</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.992" end="00:03:10.092" style="s2">each other, rather than mocking me cuz</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.092" end="00:03:12.592" style="s2">you&#39;re having more than me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.092" end="00:03:14.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t use God to explain my failure.</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.592" end="00:03:15.392" style="s2">I believe he will give me strength to</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.092" end="00:03:17.292" style="s2">keep going.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.392" end="00:03:18.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; why isn&#39;t anything working?</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.292" end="00:03:20.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; don&#39;t have an answer for you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.592" end="00:03:21.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be dramatic. We haven&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.292" end="00:03:23.492" style="s2">finished talking.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.592" end="00:03:26.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have finished talking, and I have</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.492" end="00:03:26.192" style="s2">heard enough.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.982" end="00:03:28.892" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.692" end="00:03:31.692" style="s2">Neka,</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.892" end="00:03:34.292" style="s2">don&#39;t you think we went too far?</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.692" end="00:03:37.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please. If she doesn&#39;t want the truth,</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.292" end="00:03:37.092" style="s2">that&#39;s her problem.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.992" end="00:03:55.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have some catering experience?</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.592" end="00:03:58.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma. I worked with a small event</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.992" end="00:04:00.992" style="s2">company before they closed. I handled</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.392" end="00:04:03.092" style="s2">food preparation, customer orders, and</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.992" end="00:04:03.394" style="s2">serving guests.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.092" end="00:04:05.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And why</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.394" end="00:04:07.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; did you leave your previous job?</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.694" end="00:04:09.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company closed down. It wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.494" end="00:04:11.194" style="s2">because of my performance. We need</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.294" end="00:04:13.494" style="s2">someone with experience managing a team</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.194" end="00:04:14.994" style="s2">and handling large corporate orders.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.494" end="00:04:16.294" style="s2">qualifications are good, but we have</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.994" end="00:04:18.894" style="s2">decided to move forward.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.294" end="00:04:19.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, ma&#39;am, may I ask one question?</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.894" end="00:04:21.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.894" end="00:04:23.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I am willing to start at a lower</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.494" end="00:04:26.594" style="s2">salary, would you consider giving me an</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.594" end="00:04:28.894" style="s2">opportunity to prove myself?</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.594" end="00:04:31.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand your situation,</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.894" end="00:04:35.094" style="s2">but the decision has already been made.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.894" end="00:04:35.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for your time, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.094" end="00:04:50.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have gone through your files. Your</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.594" end="00:04:51.494" style="s2">qualifications are good, but we have</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.094" end="00:04:52.594" style="s2">decided to move forward with another</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.494" end="00:04:54.294" style="s2">candidate.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.594" end="00:04:57.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, I don&#39;t mind starting with a lower</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.294" end="00:04:59.894" style="s2">salary. Please, I really need this job.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.494" end="00:05:03.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand you,</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.894" end="00:05:03.194" style="s2">but there&#39;s nothing I can do.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.918" end="00:05:24.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.694" end="00:05:38.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sometimes I wonder if</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.894" end="00:05:38.894" style="s2">I am the problem.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.794" end="00:05:44.994" style="s2">Maybe I&#39;m not good enough.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.994" end="00:05:46.294" style="s2">Maybe I&#39;m not beautiful enough.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.994" end="00:05:47.694" style="s2">Maybe there is something wrong with me</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.294" end="00:05:49.994" style="s2">because</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.694" end="00:05:51.794" style="s2">all my friends are moving forward. They</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.994" end="00:05:53.894" style="s2">are buying houses, traveling, getting</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.794" end="00:05:55.594" style="s2">married, having children,</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.894" end="00:05:56.894" style="s2">and I am here counting coins to buy</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.594" end="00:06:00.094" style="s2">food.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.894" end="00:06:01.994" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to pretend anymore, Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.094" end="00:06:04.194" style="s2">I&#39;m hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.994" end="00:06:07.095" style="s2">I&#39;m jealous sometimes.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.194" end="00:06:08.895" style="s2">I am ashamed of my life.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.095" end="00:06:10.695" style="s2">I see people who don&#39;t even care about</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.895" end="00:06:12.395" style="s2">you succeeding.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.695" end="00:06:16.395" style="s2">And I am trying my best to live right,</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.395" end="00:06:18.594" style="s2">yet everything I touch seems to fail.</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.395" end="00:06:22.195" style="s2">I don&#39;t understand you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.594" end="00:06:22.195" style="s2">[snorts] But I don&#39;t want to lose you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.095" end="00:06:30.195" style="s2">I don&#39;t need to understand everything.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.095" end="00:06:31.095" style="s2">I just need enough strength for the next</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.195" end="00:06:33.895" style="s2">step.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.095" end="00:06:33.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; raised again.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.495" end="00:06:39.495" style="s2">When I was down,</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.995" end="00:06:42.395" style="s2">you lifted [music] me. When I was lost,</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.495" end="00:06:44.795" style="s2">you guided me. When the</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.395" end="00:06:46.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amara, you have been very quiet lately,</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.795" end="00:06:47.695" style="s2">so I came to check up on you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.295" end="00:06:49.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.695" end="00:06:50.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is what people say when they don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.195" end="00:06:51.895" style="s2">want anybody to ask them the second</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.695" end="00:06:54.095" style="s2">question.</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.895" end="00:06:55.495" style="s2">All right, I won&#39;t force you to speak,</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.095" end="00:06:56.295" style="s2">but you don&#39;t have to carry everything</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.495" end="00:06:57.895" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.295" end="00:07:00.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, do you ever pray for something for</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.895" end="00:07:01.595" style="s2">so long that you begin to wonder whether</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.095" end="00:07:03.695" style="s2">God is listening?</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.595" end="00:07:05.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.695" end="00:07:07.695" style="s2">There are seasons when even a strong</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.495" end="00:07:11.195" style="s2">believer feels tired.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.695" end="00:07:12.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then how do you keep believing?</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.195" end="00:07:14.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remind myself that faith is not</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.995" end="00:07:18.095" style="s2">pretending that pain doesn&#39;t exist.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.995" end="00:07:20.195" style="s2">Faith is being honest about the pain.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.095" end="00:07:21.695" style="s2">Listen to me. Being unmarried does not</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.195" end="00:07:23.395" style="s2">make you a failure.</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.695" end="00:07:25.495" style="s2">Being poor today does not mean you will</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.395" end="00:07:27.995" style="s2">always be poor. A closed door is not</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.495" end="00:07:29.995" style="s2">proof that God has abandoned you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.995" end="00:07:32.195" style="s2">Prayer can give you strength, but you</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.995" end="00:07:33.995" style="s2">must also be willing to move when an</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.195" end="00:07:35.995" style="s2">opportunity comes.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.995" end="00:07:37.395" style="s2">Sometimes the first answer to a prayer</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.995" end="00:07:39.695" style="s2">is courage.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.395" end="00:07:41.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I cannot keep living like this.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.695" end="00:07:43.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t only pray for a different</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.195" end="00:07:45.095" style="s2">life. What can you do with the little</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.095" end="00:07:47.395" style="s2">you have? What skill can you use? What</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.095" end="00:07:49.495" style="s2">small step can you take today?</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.395" end="00:07:50.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know how to cook. I have always loved</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.495" end="00:07:51.895" style="s2">cooking.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.295" end="00:07:54.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are you waiting for somebody to</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.895" end="00:07:55.695" style="s2">employ you before you use that gift?</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.395" end="00:07:57.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have money to start up a</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.695" end="00:07:58.895" style="s2">business.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.095" end="00:08:00.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you need a big kitchen to make a good</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.895" end="00:08:02.295" style="s2">meal for one person?</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.495" end="00:08:03.495" style="s2">Start where you are. Start with whatever</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.295" end="00:08:04.895" style="s2">you have.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.495" end="00:08:06.995" style="s2">And don&#39;t be ashamed of small</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.895" end="00:08:09.297" style="s2">beginnings.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.995" end="00:08:10.597" style="s2">Get a notebook. Write down three things</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.297" end="00:08:13.197" style="s2">you can do</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.597" end="00:08:15.597" style="s2">with the skills you already have.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.197" end="00:08:17.197" style="s2">Not tomorrow, but today. Thank you so</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.597" end="00:08:18.697" style="s2">much, Mama Grace.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.197" end="00:08:20.697" style="s2">And one more thing,</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.697" end="00:08:23.697" style="s2">don&#39;t measure your life with somebody</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.697" end="00:08:23.697" style="s2">else&#39;s calendar.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.560" end="00:08:33.580" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.297" end="00:08:38.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This money will not buy anything at all,</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.297" end="00:08:41.997" style="s2">just a little rice and oil left. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.897" end="00:08:41.997" style="s2">I&#39;m really confused.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.005" end="00:08:46.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.761" end="00:08:59.781" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.001" end="00:09:05.021" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.241" end="00:09:10.916" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.896" end="00:09:10.916" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.136" end="00:09:16.156" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.341" end="00:09:23.361" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.201" end="00:09:31.221" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.751" end="00:09:37.771" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.991" end="00:09:44.297" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.297" end="00:09:47.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This looks very delicious.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.297" end="00:09:48.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Buy your sweet rice here. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.297" end="00:09:51.897" style="s2">Buy your sweet rice here.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.897" end="00:09:51.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please give me one pack.</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.097" end="00:09:58.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t encouraging at all. I worked</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.497" end="00:10:01.597" style="s2">under the sun trying to sell this food</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.497" end="00:10:01.597" style="s2">and nobody is buying.</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.536" end="00:10:09.398" style="s2">[snorts] I have another interview</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.597" end="00:10:11.598" style="s2">tomorrow. At At this should be enough</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.398" end="00:10:15.762" style="s2">for my transportation. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.598" end="00:10:15.762" style="s2">God, another failed interview. [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.327" end="00:10:20.347" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.598" end="00:10:33.392" style="s2">God, another failed interview.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.998" end="00:10:34.598" style="s2">Another closed door.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.392" end="00:10:38.498" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.598" end="00:10:40.198" style="s2">What is my crime? Am I not good enough?</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.498" end="00:10:42.398" style="s2">Look at me, so useless. I can&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.198" end="00:10:45.798" style="s2">afford anything. I&#39;m tired of pretending</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.398" end="00:10:48.998" style="s2">I&#39;m okay. I have prayed, I have fasted.</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.798" end="00:10:51.098" style="s2">I have done everything I know how to do.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.998" end="00:10:52.998" style="s2">I have looked for job for years, all</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.098" end="00:10:55.198" style="s2">failed.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.998" end="00:10:56.898" style="s2">What am I not doing right? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.198" end="00:10:58.937" style="s2">God, please don&#39;t let me lose my faith</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.898" end="00:10:59.498" style="s2">in you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.937" end="00:11:01.098" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.498" end="00:11:02.498" style="s2">I don&#39;t even have enough money to pay my</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.098" end="00:11:04.898" style="s2">rent,</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.498" end="00:11:06.998" style="s2">pay the loan I took. Every Saturday I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.898" end="00:11:08.762" style="s2">in church cleaning. I pay my tithe even</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.998" end="00:11:09.298" style="s2">when I&#39;m not having enough.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.762" end="00:11:11.198" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.298" end="00:11:12.898" style="s2">I believe you&#39;re working something. I</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.198" end="00:11:15.198" style="s2">believe you&#39;re working something big for</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.898" end="00:11:15.198" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.967" end="00:11:19.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.277" end="00:11:19.297" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.552" end="00:11:22.998" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.698" end="00:11:24.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.998" end="00:11:25.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.098" end="00:11:26.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope I&#39;m not disturbing you. My</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.698" end="00:11:28.498" style="s2">daughter has some friends coming home</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.998" end="00:11:29.798" style="s2">tomorrow. I want to prepare food, but</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.498" end="00:11:30.498" style="s2">this my waist is not allowing me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.798" end="00:11:32.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to prepare, ma?</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.498" end="00:11:34.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, sit down, Mara. You don&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.098" end="00:11:35.598" style="s2">to be tense. Are you sure you&#39;re fine?</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.398" end="00:11:38.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma. I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.598" end="00:11:40.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. I want rice and stew, maybe</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.198" end="00:11:41.598" style="s2">chicken if I can afford it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.098" end="00:11:43.898" style="s2">Can you help me cook?</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.598" end="00:11:45.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can, ma, but I don&#39;t know if I will</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.898" end="00:11:48.098" style="s2">pay you for your time. Nothing big, but</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.998" end="00:11:50.298" style="s2">at least something.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.098" end="00:11:52.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, ma. I will do it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.298" end="00:11:54.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is 30,000 naira.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.598" end="00:11:58.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jesus, 30,000 naira?</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.698" end="00:12:00.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my daughter. Just hold this one.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.098" end="00:12:02.498" style="s2">Later I will send the things you need to</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.698" end="00:12:05.698" style="s2">prepare the food to you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.498" end="00:12:05.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you so much, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.699" end="00:12:21.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When nobody [music] believed in me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.399" end="00:12:27.499" style="s2">When the whole world turned away.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.999" end="00:12:33.399" style="s2">You never left</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.299" end="00:12:33.399" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.199" end="00:12:42.399" style="s2">I cried in the middle of the night.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.499" end="00:12:45.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I have a test of it? My mouth is</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.399" end="00:12:45.399" style="s2">dripping already.</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.499" end="00:12:50.599" style="s2">Ah, this food is delicious. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.633" end="00:12:53.699" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.599" end="00:12:53.699" style="s2">Let me have a test too.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.699" end="00:12:59.299" style="s2">My daughter, you did well. [music] I</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.499" end="00:13:01.899" style="s2">will tell my colleagues about you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.299" end="00:13:05.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, ma. No, thank you. You have</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.899" end="00:13:05.099" style="s2">made my day easier.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.699" end="00:13:13.499" style="s2">Yesterday I was crying, complaining of</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.899" end="00:13:15.299" style="s2">how forgotten I have been.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.499" end="00:13:16.999" style="s2">But you came through for me, making me</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.299" end="00:13:19.599" style="s2">believe you&#39;re still watching [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.999" end="00:13:21.729" style="s2">every single day that passes by. I</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.599" end="00:13:23.299" style="s2">believe everything will change someday.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.729" end="00:13:24.599" style="s2">[singing] Thank you for what you&#39;ve done</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.299" end="00:13:26.199" style="s2">for me today. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.599" end="00:13:27.899" style="s2">It&#39;s a sign that you haven&#39;t forgotten</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.199" end="00:13:30.954" style="s2">me, Lord. I will forever remain</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.899" end="00:13:30.954" style="s2">grateful. [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.139" end="00:13:38.159" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.034" end="00:13:44.054" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.929" end="00:13:50.604" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.584" end="00:13:50.604" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.134" end="00:13:57.154" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.029" end="00:14:03.049" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.999" end="00:14:10.899" style="s2">10 people. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.199" end="00:14:12.199" style="s2">Thank you, Jesus.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.899" end="00:14:14.799" style="s2">Please let me not spoil this</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.199" end="00:14:17.459" style="s2">opportunity.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.799" end="00:14:17.459" style="s2">Thank you, Jesus. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.501" end="00:14:23.601" style="s2">At least I will keep trying until things</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.679" end="00:14:23.601" style="s2">[music] get better.</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.601" end="00:14:37.701" style="s2">Dear heavenly Father, thank you for the</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.601" end="00:14:39.901" style="s2">gift of a new day. Lord, take away this</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.701" end="00:14:42.001" style="s2">discomfort and pain. Father, order my</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.901" end="00:14:43.701" style="s2">steps today. Give me favor and let today</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.001" end="00:14:46.301" style="s2">bring good news. I pray for [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.701" end="00:14:48.501" style="s2">peace in my mind, joy in my heart, and</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.301" end="00:14:50.901" style="s2">grace to whatever today brings. I</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.501" end="00:14:53.001" style="s2">surrender this day to you, Lord. I trust</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.901" end="00:14:54.401" style="s2">that even when I cannot see it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.001" end="00:14:56.601" style="s2">Lead me, Lord. [music] Carry me through</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.401" end="00:14:58.801" style="s2">today. Let your peace that passes all</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.601" end="00:15:00.701" style="s2">understanding fill my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.801" end="00:15:01.801" style="s2">I will not give up. I will not lose</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.701" end="00:15:04.201" style="s2">faith and he [music] will see me</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.801" end="00:15:06.101" style="s2">through. Take charge over my activities</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.201" end="00:15:07.801" style="s2">today. May I not face any</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.101" end="00:15:09.501" style="s2">disappointment.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.801" end="00:15:13.601" style="s2">But even if I do, I will [music] still</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.501" end="00:15:13.601" style="s2">return all the glory to you. Amen.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.940" end="00:15:24.270" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.250" end="00:15:24.270" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.110" end="00:15:32.130" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.730" end="00:15:34.750" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.005" end="00:15:40.590" style="s2">[music] Ma.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.301" end="00:15:42.610" style="s2">Ma, the foods are ready.</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.590" end="00:15:42.610" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.105" end="00:15:51.125" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.101" end="00:15:59.001" style="s2">Thank you so much, Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.401" end="00:16:02.001" style="s2">You&#39;re welcome, ma. And thank you too</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.001" end="00:16:02.001" style="s2">for patronizing.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.301" end="00:16:04.901" style="s2">Thank you, Jesus. Thank you, Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.171" end="00:16:08.101" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.901" end="00:16:10.101" style="s2">Thank you for making today a success.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.101" end="00:16:12.801" style="s2">I know it&#39;s not much. I&#39;m really</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.101" end="00:16:12.801" style="s2">grateful.</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.476" end="00:16:26.496" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.402" end="00:16:32.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been scrolling for hours now.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.302" end="00:16:34.702" style="s2">Have you seen Amara&#39;s status?</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.602" end="00:16:37.002" style="s2">Which one?</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.702" end="00:16:39.402" style="s2">At least she&#39;s trying something.</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.002" end="00:16:41.302" style="s2">Selling food from a rented room.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.402" end="00:16:43.602" style="s2">How much can she possibly make possibly</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.302" end="00:16:43.602" style="s2">make?</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.102" end="00:16:47.902" style="s2">We shouldn&#39;t keep laughing at her,</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.402" end="00:16:50.402" style="s2">Nneka. What has come over you?</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.902" end="00:16:52.102" style="s2">Nothing. I just think we were too harsh</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.402" end="00:16:53.402" style="s2">at the restaurant. We told her the</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.102" end="00:16:55.302" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.402" end="00:16:56.902" style="s2">If she had listened to advice, perhaps</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.302" end="00:16:59.402" style="s2">her life would be different.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.902" end="00:17:00.702" style="s2">Maybe, but we don&#39;t know everything she</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.402" end="00:17:03.302" style="s2">is going through.</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.702" end="00:17:05.202" style="s2">So you&#39;re taking her side now?</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.302" end="00:17:07.602" style="s2">She&#39;s our friend, Nneka.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.202" end="00:17:09.202" style="s2">Whatever. Anyway, our anniversary dinner</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.602" end="00:17:12.102" style="s2">is this weekend. Let&#39;s see if she</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.202" end="00:17:12.102" style="s2">actually comes.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.502" end="00:17:24.202" style="s2">Hello, Nneka.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.502" end="00:17:26.502" style="s2">My dear, how are you?</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.202" end="00:17:28.402" style="s2">I&#39;m fine. How are you? We haven&#39;t seen</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.502" end="00:17:29.902" style="s2">you since that day at the restaurant.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.402" end="00:17:31.802" style="s2">You disappeared.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.902" end="00:17:34.102" style="s2">Where did you go?</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.802" end="00:17:36.802" style="s2">I didn&#39;t go to anywhere. I just needed</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.102" end="00:17:38.502" style="s2">some time to myself. Anyway, I wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.802" end="00:17:41.502" style="s2">remind you</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.502" end="00:17:44.202" style="s2">about the anniversary dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.502" end="00:17:47.102" style="s2">Congratulations, my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.202" end="00:17:48.202" style="s2">But I don&#39;t know if I can make it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.102" end="00:17:50.902" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.202" end="00:17:53.502" style="s2">Are you busy selling food?</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.902" end="00:17:54.602" style="s2">Yes, actually. I have some orders to</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.502" end="00:17:57.102" style="s2">prepare.</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.602" end="00:18:00.202" style="s2">All right then. Just don&#39;t forget us</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.102" end="00:18:02.902" style="s2">when you become a become a millionaire.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.202" end="00:18:05.102" style="s2">I won&#39;t forget anybody.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.902" end="00:18:08.902" style="s2">But I am doing this because I need to</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.102" end="00:18:08.902" style="s2">work. Fine. Take care.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.802" end="00:18:21.503" style="s2">I don&#39;t have time to prove anything to</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.003" end="00:18:21.503" style="s2">anybody.</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.503" end="00:18:27.403" style="s2">20 more,</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.003" end="00:18:30.403" style="s2">chicken,</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.403" end="00:18:33.903" style="s2">vegetables, containers. I need to</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.403" end="00:18:33.903" style="s2">calculate everything properly.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.303" end="00:18:47.803" style="s2">Mr. Amara, what did you put in this</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.803" end="00:18:48.577" style="s2">food? It is so delicious. Honestly, this</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.803" end="00:18:49.503" style="s2">food is good.</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.577" end="00:18:51.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.503" end="00:18:53.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m glad you like it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.198" end="00:18:53.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.473" end="00:18:58.458" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.438" end="00:18:58.458" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.403" end="00:19:04.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, miss.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.003" end="00:19:06.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.703" end="00:19:07.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, how much do you sell a plate of</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.203" end="00:19:09.403" style="s2">food?</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.103" end="00:19:12.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2,000 naira and 1,000 naira.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.403" end="00:19:14.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, I would love to have one.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.203" end="00:19:14.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.203" end="00:19:29.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How come you&#39;re selling on the roadside?</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.203" end="00:19:31.303" style="s2">This meal is too [music] good.</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.203" end="00:19:33.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a small start, sir. By God&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.303" end="00:19:33.703" style="s2">grace, I will get a bigger place one</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.003" end="00:19:35.403" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.703" end="00:19:37.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you learn catering?</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.403" end="00:19:39.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir. I did. I even worked at a food</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.903" end="00:19:41.603" style="s2">company before they closed. [music] The</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.403" end="00:19:43.403" style="s2">company had issues, so the company had</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.603" end="00:19:44.703" style="s2">issues, so it was shut down.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.403" end="00:19:46.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you couldn&#39;t apply in another</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.703" end="00:19:47.503" style="s2">companies?</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.203" end="00:19:48.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did, sir, for [music] three good</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.503" end="00:19:50.603" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.503" end="00:19:52.103" style="s2">No company accepted me. They said my</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.603" end="00:19:54.003" style="s2">qualifications are good, but I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.103" end="00:19:56.303" style="s2">get the jobs. [music] So I decided to</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.003" end="00:19:58.703" style="s2">start off this instead.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.303" end="00:20:01.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.703" end="00:20:03.603" style="s2">You are a very good cook.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.703" end="00:20:06.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you so much, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.603" end="00:20:08.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to offer you a job.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.803" end="00:20:11.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t understand, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.903" end="00:20:13.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, you heard me right.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.503" end="00:20:15.903" style="s2">Actually, my company is hosting hosting</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.603" end="00:20:17.703" style="s2">some important clients tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.903" end="00:20:19.303" style="s2">and I want you to make the food they</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.703" end="00:20:20.703" style="s2">will eat.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.303" end="00:20:23.003" style="s2">Can you do it?</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.703" end="00:20:23.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Yes, I can do it, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.003" end="00:20:25.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very good. I</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.605" end="00:20:27.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; have tested your food and this is</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.205" end="00:20:28.305" style="s2">exactly what I want.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.005" end="00:20:30.305" style="s2">I believe you will be able to deliver</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.305" end="00:20:31.805" style="s2">200 plates of food tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.305" end="00:20:34.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 200 plates?</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.805" end="00:20:36.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 200 for both the clients and some</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.605" end="00:20:40.505" style="s2">workers.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.905" end="00:20:44.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, sir. I will try my best.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.505" end="00:20:45.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. And what&#39;s your name, please?</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.305" end="00:20:47.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My name is Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.605" end="00:20:50.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Chika. Can I have your number so we</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.705" end="00:20:50.705" style="s2">can discuss the price?</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.605" end="00:21:01.605" style="s2">All right, we will talk when I get home.</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.005" end="00:21:01.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, sir. Thank you so much.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.905" end="00:21:09.605" style="s2">Thank you, Lord, for today&#39;s sales</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.305" end="00:21:09.605" style="s2">and the opportunity you brought.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.405" end="00:21:14.505" style="s2">Lord, you&#39;re making it happen.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.405" end="00:21:17.405" style="s2">I can&#39;t believe this. I can&#39;t believe my</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.505" end="00:21:19.405" style="s2">life right now, but I&#39;m grateful.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.405" end="00:21:21.805" style="s2">I&#39;m so grateful. [music] My years of</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.405" end="00:21:23.605" style="s2">suffering are coming to an end. I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.805" end="00:21:25.305" style="s2">beg to feed anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.605" end="00:21:28.805" style="s2">I won&#39;t collect loan anymore. I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.305" end="00:21:28.805" style="s2">suffer anymore. I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.019" end="00:21:33.039" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.259" end="00:21:38.279" style="s2">[singing and music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.774" end="00:21:46.794" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.049" end="00:21:50.070" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.530" end="00:22:00.550" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.005" end="00:22:13.205" style="s2">Heavenly Father, I come before you today</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.005" end="00:22:15.105" style="s2">with a heart full of gratitude. Thank</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.205" end="00:22:17.205" style="s2">you for the gift of life, for your</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.105" end="00:22:18.305" style="s2">mercy, your protection, and your endless</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.205" end="00:22:20.205" style="s2">love.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.305" end="00:22:21.905" style="s2">Bless the work of my hands and crown my</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.205" end="00:22:23.705" style="s2">efforts with success.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.905" end="00:22:26.106" style="s2">Let every door meant for me open [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.705" end="00:22:27.806" style="s2">at the right time. Connect me with right</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.106" end="00:22:29.706" style="s2">people and blessing. Father, remove</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.806" end="00:22:30.906" style="s2">every obstacle standing in the way of my</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.706" end="00:22:32.106" style="s2">progress.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.906" end="00:22:34.206" style="s2">Give me wisdom to make the right</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.106" end="00:22:36.006" style="s2">decisions, courage to face challenges,</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.206" end="00:22:38.306" style="s2">patience to time in, and strength never</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.006" end="00:22:40.006" style="s2">to give up. May my life be a testimony</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.306" end="00:22:42.606" style="s2">of your goodness.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.006" end="00:22:44.306" style="s2">Let me succeed beyond my expectations so</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.606" end="00:22:46.606" style="s2">I can be a blessing.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.306" end="00:22:49.906" style="s2">Replace every fear with faith, every</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.606" end="00:22:52.206" style="s2">disappointment with hope,</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.906" end="00:22:54.706" style="s2">and every struggle with victory. Lord,</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.206" end="00:22:57.406" style="s2">as I step into this day, let your favor</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.706" end="00:22:59.906" style="s2">go before me. May I find grace wherever</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.406" end="00:23:01.406" style="s2">I go. Bless me with peace, good health,</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.906" end="00:23:03.606" style="s2">financial breakthrough,</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.406" end="00:23:06.206" style="s2">and divine direction. May I not be</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.606" end="00:23:08.806" style="s2">disappointed. Go with me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.206" end="00:23:08.806" style="s2">Amen.</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.106" end="00:23:12.306" style="s2">Good morning, Mr. Chika.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.006" end="00:23:13.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome, Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.306" end="00:23:14.706" style="s2">Everything is intact.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.706" end="00:23:17.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, [music] sir.</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.706" end="00:23:17.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Let&#39;s go inside.</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.096" end="00:23:21.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.646" end="00:23:27.666" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.816" end="00:23:39.306" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.106" end="00:23:41.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me, ma. This food is too good.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.306" end="00:23:43.386" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My goodness, Mara. This is amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.366" end="00:23:43.386" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.006" end="00:23:48.206" style="s2">I am really impressed.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.606" end="00:23:49.806" style="s2">Everyone is talking about your food</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.206" end="00:23:52.606" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.806" end="00:23:54.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you so much, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.606" end="00:23:55.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for making me trust you. From</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.206" end="00:23:56.706" style="s2">now on, you will be the only chief for</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.806" end="00:23:57.706" style="s2">my company.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.706" end="00:23:59.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.706" end="00:24:00.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. And also, I will connect you to</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.406" end="00:24:02.806" style="s2">people around me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.906" end="00:24:03.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you so much, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.806" end="00:24:06.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Check your phone.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.906" end="00:24:06.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.706" end="00:24:12.606" style="s2">Sir, this is too much.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.906" end="00:24:15.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s your balance and a compensation</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.606" end="00:24:15.006" style="s2">from me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.206" end="00:24:18.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank [snorts] you so much, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.506" end="00:24:20.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, no. Stand up, Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.806" end="00:24:22.306" style="s2">It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.506" end="00:24:23.906" style="s2">I should head back inside. I will call</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.306" end="00:24:25.206" style="s2">you whenever I have a job for you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.906" end="00:24:27.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.206" end="00:24:27.706" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.526" end="00:24:30.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.908" end="00:24:36.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; God, I cannot thank you enough. I can</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.107" end="00:24:39.207" style="s2">now pay my house rent, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.908" end="00:24:41.627" style="s2">get food stuffs for my business little</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.207" end="00:24:43.607" style="s2">by little.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.627" end="00:24:45.807" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.607" end="00:24:48.307" style="s2">I have an order to pack tomorrow, a lot</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.807" end="00:24:51.207" style="s2">of orders. God, I can&#39;t believe this.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.307" end="00:24:52.707" style="s2">Thank you Jesus.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.207" end="00:24:54.607" style="s2">Thank you for not letting me lose my</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.707" end="00:24:57.707" style="s2">faith in you after [music] how many</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.607" end="00:24:57.707" style="s2">years of struggling.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.107" end="00:25:02.642" style="s2">Lord, I&#39;m so grateful. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.207" end="00:25:07.227" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.447" end="00:25:12.467" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.032" end="00:25:17.052" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.167" end="00:25:28.842" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.822" end="00:25:28.842" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.408" end="00:25:32.908" style="s2">Oh my God.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.908" end="00:25:35.807" style="s2">Orders are still coming in.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.908" end="00:25:35.807" style="s2">Thank you Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.307" end="00:25:41.107" style="s2">I still can&#39;t believe this is my life</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.807" end="00:25:43.007" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.107" end="00:25:46.007" style="s2">It&#39;s not much but my life is getting</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.007" end="00:25:46.007" style="s2">better every day.</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.507" end="00:25:52.207" style="s2">God, I am so grateful</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.807" end="00:25:55.007" style="s2">for all these opportunities you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.207" end="00:25:55.007" style="s2">bringing [music] to me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.507" end="00:26:00.908" style="s2">God, I&#39;m so confused right now.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.207" end="00:26:04.507" style="s2">A lot of orders to pack and my dispatch</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.908" end="00:26:04.507" style="s2">rider has already carried a lot.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.807" end="00:26:08.207" style="s2">Are you sure I&#39;m going to meet up with</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.307" end="00:26:11.007" style="s2">all these orders? Cuz I don&#39;t know where</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.207" end="00:26:11.007" style="s2">to start from.</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.207" end="00:26:19.307" style="s2">Calls are still coming in.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.107" end="00:26:22.107" style="s2">Orders are still coming.</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.307" end="00:26:23.408" style="s2">At this point, I think I need workers.</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.107" end="00:26:24.607" style="s2">Look at the time you&#39;re bringing my</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.408" end="00:26:26.807" style="s2">orders.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.607" end="00:26:30.507" style="s2">Is this how poor your services are? I&#39;m</p>
