<p begin="00:26:39.528" end="00:26:42.309" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.838" end="00:26:43.909" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.309" end="00:26:45.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have been losing a lot of money these</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.909" end="00:26:47.409" style="s2">days. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.309" end="00:26:49.709" style="s2">I&#39;m tired and exhausted, but I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.409" end="00:26:51.973" style="s2">give up. I will keep pushing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.709" end="00:26:52.509" style="s2">I have come too far to give up.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.973" end="00:26:54.209" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.509" end="00:26:57.809" style="s2">God, please give me the strength to do</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.209" end="00:26:57.809" style="s2">this business cuz I&#39;m tired.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.763" end="00:27:08.109" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.609" end="00:27:09.909" style="s2">Before we begin, pay attention. We have</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.109" end="00:27:12.609" style="s2">customers to serve.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.909" end="00:27:14.709" style="s2">Our priority [music] is good food,</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.609" end="00:27:16.409" style="s2">cleanliness, and teamwork. Jenny, you</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.709" end="00:27:16.809" style="s2">will help me prepare meat, chicken, and</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.409" end="00:27:17.518" style="s2">fish.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.809" end="00:27:18.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.518" end="00:27:20.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.609" end="00:27:21.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you Grace, wash, peel, and cut</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.409" end="00:27:23.709" style="s2">veggies for me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.309" end="00:27:23.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.653" end="00:27:30.674" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.549" end="00:27:37.224" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.204" end="00:27:37.224" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.134" end="00:27:41.154" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.409" end="00:27:47.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is enough. This is a big win for</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.509" end="00:27:47.509" style="s2">me, Lord. [music] I am grateful.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.509" end="00:27:52.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m hosting an event and someone named</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.509" end="00:27:54.409" style="s2">Mr. Chika gave me [music] your number.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.409" end="00:27:56.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Mr. Chika, I know him.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.409" end="00:27:58.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe I won&#39;t regret coming here.</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.509" end="00:27:59.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, sir. You came to the right</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.009" end="00:28:02.309" style="s2">place. [music] How many portions have we</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.809" end="00:28:04.109" style="s2">prepared so far?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.309" end="00:28:05.309" style="s2">How many are remaining?</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.109" end="00:28:07.909" style="s2">Please make sure [music] we follow the</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.309" end="00:28:09.409" style="s2">agreed menu and portion sizes. Chef</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.909" end="00:28:10.509" style="s2">David, please I need an update on the</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.409" end="00:28:12.109" style="s2">remaining food. [music] How many</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.509" end="00:28:13.609" style="s2">portions do we have left and how many</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.109" end="00:28:15.209" style="s2">guests are still waiting?</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.609" end="00:28:16.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, ma. Let me check up the team in</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.209" end="00:28:17.509" style="s2">charge of that.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.469" end="00:28:19.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.509" end="00:28:21.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, I want us to control our food</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.309" end="00:28:22.909" style="s2">distribution properly. We have 500</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.809" end="00:28:24.109" style="s2">expected guests.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.909" end="00:28:25.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma. We are on it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.109" end="00:28:27.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And we must ensure that everybody is</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.809" end="00:28:28.909" style="s2">served.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.409" end="00:28:31.009" style="s2">Do not open extra food containers</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.909" end="00:28:32.709" style="s2">unnecessarily. Keep hot food hot and</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.009" end="00:28:34.310" style="s2">cold food food Do not mix fresh food</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.709" end="00:28:35.410" style="s2">with leftovers. If food is running low,</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.310" end="00:28:36.010" style="s2">inform me immediately before it</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.410" end="00:28:37.310" style="s2">finishes.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.010" end="00:28:38.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma&#39;am. I will inform you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.310" end="00:28:41.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need you to concentrate on your</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.710" end="00:28:43.010" style="s2">assignment. We are working against time,</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.010" end="00:28:44.710" style="s2">and every [music] worker is important.</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.010" end="00:28:46.110" style="s2">If you have any difficulty, report to me</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.710" end="00:28:49.310" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.110" end="00:28:49.310" style="s2">Welcome, sir. Welcome, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.810" end="00:28:53.410" style="s2">Welcome, ma&#39;am. Congratulations, my</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.910" end="00:28:56.410" style="s2">dear.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.410" end="00:28:58.710" style="s2">Thank you so much, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.410" end="00:29:00.510" style="s2">Amara, [music] you made me proud. Mama</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.710" end="00:29:02.710" style="s2">Grace, it&#39;s all your advice and words of</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.510" end="00:29:05.010" style="s2">encouragement. Your God sent. I&#39;m so</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.710" end="00:29:06.310" style="s2">proud of you. Thank you so much, Mama</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.010" end="00:29:08.215" style="s2">Grace.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.310" end="00:29:10.210" style="s2">It still feels like a dream to me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.215" end="00:29:12.210" style="s2">[crying] God has changed my story. I</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.210" end="00:29:14.610" style="s2">can&#39;t believe this. [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.210" end="00:29:17.510" style="s2">Congratulations, my dear. God is an</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.610" end="00:29:17.510" style="s2">awesome God.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.590" end="00:29:26.610" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.210" end="00:29:29.230" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.310" end="00:29:42.330" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.310" end="00:29:49.710" style="s2">This is my new home. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.410" end="00:29:52.210" style="s2">God,</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.710" end="00:29:53.310" style="s2">I am now a home owner.</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.210" end="00:29:56.685" style="s2">God,</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.310" end="00:29:58.705" style="s2">I now have a home of my own.</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.685" end="00:29:58.705" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.110" end="00:30:02.210" style="s2">Father, thank you for everything you</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.710" end="00:30:04.010" style="s2">have done for me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.210" end="00:30:06.510" style="s2">Lord, we are grateful because you have</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.010" end="00:30:08.810" style="s2">done what no man could do.</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.510" end="00:30:11.210" style="s2">I fought in silence. [music] The tears I</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.810" end="00:30:13.510" style="s2">shed in secret.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.210" end="00:30:15.010" style="s2">When people thought my story was over,</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.510" end="00:30:16.410" style="s2">you stepped in and gave me a new</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.010" end="00:30:17.610" style="s2">beginning.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.410" end="00:30:18.810" style="s2">Thank you because you have been my</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.610" end="00:30:21.010" style="s2">strength [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.810" end="00:30:22.810" style="s2">through difficult times. My comfort in</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.010" end="00:30:24.910" style="s2">moments of and my hope when life seemed</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.810" end="00:30:27.010" style="s2">unbearable. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.910" end="00:30:28.610" style="s2">I have been through so much.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.010" end="00:30:30.010" style="s2">God, you turned my pain into a</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.610" end="00:30:31.810" style="s2">testimony,</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.010" end="00:30:34.110" style="s2">my tears into [music] joy, and my</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.810" end="00:30:37.112" style="s2">struggles into something</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.110" end="00:30:38.812" style="s2">May this house become a home filled with</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.112" end="00:30:40.112" style="s2">May it be filled with happiness, love,</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.812" end="00:30:41.612" style="s2">and laughter.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.112" end="00:30:44.312" style="s2">May my hotel become a place [music] of</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.612" end="00:30:46.612" style="s2">great success and prosperity.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.312" end="00:30:48.212" style="s2">From having almost nothing [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.612" end="00:30:50.412" style="s2">to becoming a proud homeowner,</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.212" end="00:30:52.361" style="s2">restaurant, and a hotel owner,</p>
