<p begin="00:30:52.361" end="00:30:55.912" style="s2">[singing] faithfulness.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.326" end="00:30:57.012" style="s2">[music] Indeed, Lord, you came through</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.912" end="00:30:59.212" style="s2">for me in</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.012" end="00:31:00.221" style="s2">perfect timing.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.212" end="00:31:03.112" style="s2">Thank you [music] for your endless</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.221" end="00:31:03.112" style="s2">[singing] blessings.</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.806" end="00:31:06.826" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.081" end="00:31:10.101" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.976" end="00:31:15.996" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.512" end="00:31:24.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, someone is looking for you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.801" end="00:31:26.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.012" end="00:31:28.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, I&#39;m coming.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.212" end="00:31:29.312" style="s2">This is our home now.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.012" end="00:31:31.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our?</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.312" end="00:31:32.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mama Grace. This is your home as</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.112" end="00:31:34.112" style="s2">well. [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.412" end="00:31:35.712" style="s2">You took care of me like your own. Thank</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.112" end="00:31:38.312" style="s2">you so much.</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.712" end="00:31:39.912" style="s2">Amara, my daughter, I&#39;m so proud of you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.312" end="00:31:42.112" style="s2">God used you to change my life</p>
