<p begin="00:31:45.912" end="00:31:49.312" style="s2">Honestly, Blessing, that was years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.612" end="00:31:50.912" style="s2">Why bring it back?</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.312" end="00:31:54.212" style="s2">Cuz every time I think about it, it</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.912" end="00:31:56.412" style="s2">makes me laugh so hard. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.212" end="00:31:57.712" style="s2">Just take a look at this.</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.412" end="00:31:59.912" style="s2">But wait, when was the last time you</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.712" end="00:32:01.812" style="s2">heard from Mara?</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.912" end="00:32:03.012" style="s2">I really can&#39;t remember.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.812" end="00:32:05.412" style="s2">We aren&#39;t good friends, you know that,</p>
