<p begin="00:32:49.213" end="00:32:54.413" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.513" end="00:32:56.413" style="s2">Don&#39;t be scared. Let&#39;s go inside.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.413" end="00:32:58.013" style="s2">Are you sure? &#39;Cause I feel so awful</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.413" end="00:33:00.813" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.013" end="00:33:00.813" style="s2">Yes, let&#39;s go.</p>
