<p begin="00:33:14.713" end="00:33:19.513" style="s2">Hi.</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.913" end="00:33:19.513" style="s2">Please have a seat. You&#39;re welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.313" end="00:33:25.113" style="s2">It&#39;s been 2 years since I saw you guys.</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.313" end="00:33:26.513" style="s2">How have you guys been? [music] Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.113" end="00:33:29.513" style="s2">You&#39;re right. You didn&#39;t tell us you</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.513" end="00:33:31.213" style="s2">opened a restaurant.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.513" end="00:33:34.113" style="s2">Oh, about that. I am so [music] sorry,</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.213" end="00:33:36.913" style="s2">guys. I must have forgotten. Forgotten?</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.113" end="00:33:39.413" style="s2">Yeah. Mara, we know we treated you so</p>
