<p begin="00:33:52.213" end="00:33:56.213" style="s2">or telling you about my achievement. I</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.013" end="00:33:57.613" style="s2">know. I did that because true friends</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.213" end="00:33:59.113" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t mock you. They will be there</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.613" end="00:34:01.313" style="s2">for each other.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.113" end="00:34:03.713" style="s2">I was so terrible to you. I mocked you</p>
