<p begin="00:34:11.913" end="00:34:15.613" style="s2">Thank you so much, Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.013" end="00:34:18.513" style="s2">I know I don&#39;t deserve your forgiveness,</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.613" end="00:34:18.513" style="s2">but thank [music] you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.653" end="00:34:22.673" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.893" end="00:34:27.913" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.513" end="00:34:30.533" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.098" end="00:34:37.213" style="s2">[music] God, you did it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.313" end="00:34:38.993" style="s2">You changed my story.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.213" end="00:34:40.313" style="s2">When everyone thought I was a failure,</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.993" end="00:34:42.314" style="s2">[singing] you stepped [music] into my</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.313" end="00:34:44.888" style="s2">life in your own perfect time. There was</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.314" end="00:34:45.414" style="s2">a time I struggled to pay my rent.</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.888" end="00:34:47.114" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.414" end="00:34:49.114" style="s2">I watched my friend celebrate while I</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.114" end="00:34:51.439" style="s2">wondered when my day would come. People</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.114" end="00:34:53.514" style="s2">laughed at me. Some called me foolish</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.439" end="00:34:55.814" style="s2">[music] for holding on to faith</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.514" end="00:34:57.914" style="s2">when nothing seemed to be working.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.814" end="00:34:59.299" style="s2">My journey was not easy.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.914" end="00:35:00.514" style="s2">There were tears and disappointments,</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.299" end="00:35:03.714" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.514" end="00:35:05.114" style="s2">but I kept moving forward.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.714" end="00:35:07.414" style="s2">Listen, no matter what you&#39;re going</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.114" end="00:35:09.114" style="s2">through, no matter how difficult, have</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.414" end="00:35:11.214" style="s2">faith. [music] Keep praying and</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.114" end="00:35:14.014" style="s2">believing. He will come through in his</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.214" end="00:35:14.014" style="s2">perfect time.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.714" end="00:35:18.514" style="s2">Lord, I&#39;m grateful, [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.214" end="00:35:21.314" style="s2">so, [music] so grateful</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.514" end="00:35:21.314" style="s2">for everything.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.879" end="00:35:25.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
