<p begin="00:35:30.084" end="00:35:32.104" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.324" end="00:35:37.344" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.219" end="00:35:43.239" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.459" end="00:35:48.479" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.734" end="00:35:51.754" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.354" end="00:35:54.374" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.904" end="00:36:02.890" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.869" end="00:36:02.890" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.799" end="00:36:06.819" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.005" end="00:36:14.025" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.244" end="00:36:19.265" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.450" end="00:36:26.470" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.275" end="00:36:36.950" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.930" end="00:36:36.950" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.515" end="00:36:42.116" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.170" end="00:36:43.316" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.116" end="00:36:45.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; light will shine.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.316" end="00:36:46.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at my life.</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.316" end="00:36:46.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at my life.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.065" end="00:36:47.375" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.716" end="00:36:49.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.375" end="00:36:49.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.116" end="00:36:53.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I was rejected, but now [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.615" end="00:36:54.716" style="s2">[singing] I stand.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.516" end="00:36:55.716" style="s2">But now</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.716" end="00:36:56.516" style="s2">I stand.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.716" end="00:36:57.855" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I stand.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.516" end="00:36:59.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You held my</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.855" end="00:37:01.216" style="s2">[music] future.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.716" end="00:37:03.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drown, drown [singing] in your</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.216" end="00:37:03.316" style="s2">hand.</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.116" end="00:37:05.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will [music] stand.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.316" end="00:37:08.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will stand.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.816" end="00:37:09.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My victory [singing] was in your plan.</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.616" end="00:37:10.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Through the tears.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.216" end="00:37:10.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Through the tears.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.316" end="00:37:11.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Through the pain.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.955" end="00:37:13.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.016" end="00:37:15.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Through the pain.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.016" end="00:37:15.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I held on to my faith.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.516" end="00:37:23.816" style="s2">Never give up. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.816" end="00:37:24.616" style="s2">The story is not [singing] over.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.816" end="00:37:25.365" style="s2">Keep</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.616" end="00:37:27.116" style="s2">believing.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.365" end="00:37:28.116" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.116" end="00:37:30.216" style="s2">Keep</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.116" end="00:37:33.116" style="s2">working.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.216" end="00:37:33.116" style="s2">Keep your faith.</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.816" end="00:37:37.416" style="s2">My time has come.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.501" end="00:37:39.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.416" end="00:37:39.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My time has come.</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.816" end="00:37:49.001" style="s2">Thank you, Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.981" end="00:37:49.001" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.316" end="00:37:58.016" style="s2">Thank you, Lord.</p>
